  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:02.170" end="00:05.490" ttm:agent="v1">빛을 잃긴 싫어</p>
      <p begin="00:05.490" end="00:09.280" ttm:agent="v1">Hehehe, Shenron, what the fuck?</p>
      <p begin="00:09.280" end="00:10.920" ttm:agent="v1">Got me sayin' like, &quot;What's up, lil' bitch?</p>
      <p begin="00:10.920" end="00:12.620" ttm:agent="v1">Do you really want love? No lies and shit&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:12.620" end="00:15.280" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause lately I've been thinkin' you just hit my line to fuck</p>
      <p begin="00:15.280" end="00:17.180" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, I really thought I found my other half, no luck</p>
      <p begin="00:17.180" end="00:18.680" ttm:agent="v1">Think I'm runnin' out of love</p>
      <p begin="00:18.400" end="00:19.900" ttm:agent="v1">Late night, are you dreamin' of me?</p>
      <p begin="00:19.800" end="00:21.860" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna lose you, baby, please don't leave</p>
      <p begin="00:21.860" end="00:23.630" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been stackin' all these bands for a minute</p>
      <p begin="00:23.630" end="00:25.130" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I've been countin' these digits</p>
      <p begin="00:24.660" end="00:26.420" ttm:agent="v1">And we can skrrt off in the whip, we goin' fast with no limit</p>
      <p begin="00:26.420" end="00:27.920" ttm:agent="v1">Got me sayin' like, &quot;What's up, lil' bitch?</p>
      <p begin="00:27.850" end="00:30.350" ttm:agent="v1">Do you really want love? No lies and shit&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:30.350" end="00:32.480" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause lately I've been thinking you just hit my line to fuck</p>
      <p begin="00:32.480" end="00:34.670" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, I really thought I found my other half, no luck</p>
      <p begin="00:34.670" end="00:36.170" ttm:agent="v1">Think I'm runnin' out of love</p>
      <p begin="00:35.870" end="00:37.370" ttm:agent="v1">Late night, are you dreamin' of me?</p>
      <p begin="00:37.280" end="00:39.160" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna lose you, baby, please don't leave</p>
      <p begin="00:39.160" end="00:41.020" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been stackin' all these bands for a minute</p>
      <p begin="00:41.020" end="00:42.520" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I've been countin' these digits</p>
      <p begin="00:42.110" end="00:44.050" ttm:agent="v1">And we can skrrt off in the whip, we goin' fast with no limit</p>
      <p begin="00:44.050" end="00:45.940" ttm:agent="v1">I've been runnin' out of love, but damn, I get that shit back</p>
      <p begin="00:45.940" end="00:47.880" ttm:agent="v1">These bitches wanna fuck with me because I'm gettin' the racks</p>
      <p begin="00:47.880" end="00:50.250" ttm:agent="v1">She said she wanna go and smoke, but can we smoke enough gas?</p>
      <p begin="00:50.250" end="00:52.590" ttm:agent="v1">She said she sorry for that shit, I'll leave it all in the past</p>
      <p begin="00:52.590" end="00:54.090" ttm:agent="v1">I just down another bottle</p>
      <p begin="00:53.520" end="00:55.080" ttm:agent="v1">Now you know I'm gettin' sick of this sippin'</p>
      <p begin="00:55.080" end="00:57.030" ttm:agent="v1">And I've been ballin' so hard, bitch, I feel like I'm Pippen</p>
      <p begin="00:57.030" end="00:59.080" ttm:agent="v1">I make a three-point swish 'cause you know I ain't missin'</p>
      <p begin="00:59.080" end="01:01.050" ttm:agent="v1">I want love, not lust, 'cause she seein' the vision</p>
      <p begin="01:01.050" end="01:03.830" ttm:agent="v1">I want love, not lust, I just need yo' trust</p>
      <p begin="01:03.830" end="01:05.970" ttm:agent="v1">Now yo' ex a fuckin' lame, that's why I keep the heater tucked</p>
      <p begin="01:05.970" end="01:08.070" ttm:agent="v1">All these racks comin' in got me sayin', &quot;What the fuck?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:08.070" end="01:10.550" ttm:agent="v1">Like, spend yo' rent just to have a little fun night</p>
      <p begin="01:10.550" end="01:12.260" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, come through, let me hit it, kung fu</p>
      <p begin="01:12.260" end="01:14.570" ttm:agent="v1">I just want one bitch, and that bitch is you</p>
      <p begin="01:14.570" end="01:16.250" ttm:agent="v1">I can give you my heart, just don't break it</p>
      <p begin="01:16.250" end="01:18.570" ttm:agent="v1">Got a fat ass, so I tell that bitch, &quot;Shake it&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:18.570" end="01:20.070" ttm:agent="v1">Got me sayin' like, &quot;What's up, lil' bitch?</p>
      <p begin="01:20.030" end="01:22.190" ttm:agent="v1">Do you really want love? No lies and shit&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:22.190" end="01:24.330" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause lately I've been thinking you just hit my line to fuck</p>
      <p begin="01:24.330" end="01:26.450" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, I really thought I found my other half, no luck</p>
      <p begin="01:26.450" end="01:27.950" ttm:agent="v1">Think I'm runnin' out of love</p>
      <p begin="01:27.740" end="01:29.240" ttm:agent="v1">Late night, are you dreamin' of me?</p>
      <p begin="01:28.980" end="01:31.130" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna lose you, baby, please don't leave</p>
      <p begin="01:31.130" end="01:32.720" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been stackin' all these bands for a minute</p>
      <p begin="01:32.720" end="01:34.220" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I've been countin' these digits</p>
      <p begin="01:34.140" end="01:35.700" ttm:agent="v1">And we can skrrt off in the whip, we goin' fast with no limit</p>
      <p begin="01:35.700" end="01:37.380" ttm:agent="v1">Got me sayin' like, &quot;What's up, lil' bitch?</p>
      <p begin="01:37.380" end="01:39.570" ttm:agent="v1">Do you really want love? No lies and shit&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:39.570" end="01:41.720" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause lately I've been thinking you just hit my line to fuck</p>
      <p begin="01:41.720" end="01:43.730" ttm:agent="v1">Damn, I really thought I found my other half, no luck</p>
      <p begin="01:43.730" end="01:45.230" ttm:agent="v1">Think I'm runnin' out of love</p>
      <p begin="01:44.920" end="01:46.420" ttm:agent="v1">Late night, are you dreamin' of me?</p>
      <p begin="01:46.410" end="01:48.590" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna lose you, baby, please don't leave</p>
      <p begin="01:48.590" end="01:50.110" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I've been stackin' all these bands for a minute</p>
      <p begin="01:50.110" end="01:51.610" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I've been countin' these digits</p>
      <p begin="01:51.230" end="01:54.070" ttm:agent="v1">And we can skrrt off in the whip, we goin' fast with no limit on</p>
